comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-23T15:20:03.046Z",codex-agent,"Plan: reconcile 7 unprotected records against main 1bb9e2bfebdde13041e75f5fa9889a97ed577052. Open PR changed tracker files and text were checked through REST. Recent push events were combined with currently live branch refs and changed tracker files; deleted refs are not active contention. No source changes or full local release reruns; CI owns the complete release gate. Preserve all prior history bytes."
  "2026-10-23T15:22:32.141Z",codex-agent,"Reconciliation writes complete. Linked git diff --check passed. All delivery coordinates and evidence files were checked against main; owner decisions and incomplete acceptance were retained as open. Final changelog generation/check, pinned health, append-only history, lifecycle/privacy/scope checks and push verification follow before PR submission. Full npm/Bun release gates are delegated to CI. This audit item remains open pending orchestrator review/merge."
  "2026-10-23T15:24:52.898Z",codex-agent,"Local tracker-only gate receipt: npm run changelog:full and npm run changelog:check both exit 0; npx pm health --json exits 0 in normal and isolated identities. Isolated health checks: 10 categories; advisory categories: none. Integrity and history drift pass. Linked git diff --check already passed. Original histories, expected lifecycles, protected records, public-safe added text and explicit tracker/changelog-only paths are independently asserted before commit. This comment is followed by final changelog regeneration/check and health. Complete npm/Bun release gates remain CI work; audit stays open pending review/merge."
